      "id": "sJtsgS6lUBgvN02R",
      "name": "Exalted Greatness",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "sJtsgS6lUBgvN02R",
        "folder": "42I1TSjgJPSlmPEo",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Exalted Greatness",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You improve your exalted reaction with the benefit listed for your cause.</p>\n<p><strong>Desecration</strong> While you have the benefit, you also gain a +2 status bonus to saving throws against effects created by enemies in your champion's aura.</p>\n<p><strong>Grandeur</strong> Any <em>revealing light</em> created by your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Flash of Grandeur] lasts for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Iniquity</strong> The damage dealt to enemies other than the triggering creatures increases by an amount equal to the damage dice of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Destructive Vengeance] (apply this after you halve the damage).</p>\n<p><strong>Justice</strong> The penalty is –2 instead of –5.</p>\n<p><strong>Liberation</strong> You and all affected allies can attempt to break free, not just the triggering ally.</p>\n<p><strong>Obedience</strong> The damage dealt to creatures other than the triggering creature who refuse to drop @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone] increases to half the damage the triggering creature would take (roll the damage only once for all affected creatures).</p>\n<p><strong>Redemption</strong> The resistance isn't reduced.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 14
          },
